      "text": "Hebt die Genauigkeit eines Pokémon im Kampf\nstark an. Die Wirkung wird mit dem Austausch des\nPokémon beendet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta mucho la Precisión en combate. Al cambiar\nde Pokémon, el efecto desaparece.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta di molto la precisione di un Pokémon\nin una lotta. L’effetto svanisce se il Pokémon\nè sostituito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item that sharply boosts the accuracy of a\nPokémon during a battle. It wears off once the\nPokémon is withdrawn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "戦闘中の　ポケモンの\n命中を　大きく　あげる　道具。\nひっこめると　元に　戻る。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大幅提高战斗中\n宝可梦命中的道具。\n离场后，效果便会消失。",
      "version_group": {
